WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
Now grandma will make you a sandwich.

2
00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:02.500
Okay.

3
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.280
Just slice the salami thinner.

4
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.760
All right, son, grandma will slice it thin.

5
00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:10.640
Thinner, grandma, slice it thinner, I like it when it is cut thin.

6
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:11.820
Do not you worry about anything.

7
00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.280
Grandma is making it so that you eat.

8
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:16.740
Here is your sandwich.

9
00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:18.620
Well, grandma, is that thinly sliced?

10
00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:21.780
Well, son, I could not do it thinner.

11
00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.800
I feel sick just looking at it, so I cannot eat it.

12
00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:26.920
Come on, do not talk nonsense, just eat.

13
00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.120
Oh, give it here, I will cut it for you, come on.
